      "content": "Dear [Journalist's Name],\n\nThank you for bringing this to our attention. At Aegis Global, the integrity and security of our systems, as well as user data, are of paramount importance to us. As such, while we are currently conducting a thorough investigation into all aspects of our operations, we do not disclose specific details concerning any incidents or inquiries unless legally obligated or required to do so. We appreciate your understanding and patience as we work diligently to ensure the continued security and trust of our users.\n\nWarm regards,\n\n[Your Name]\n\n[Your Position]",
